KNOWNBUG libcxx
main.cpp
--cpp11 --stdlib libc++
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ __type_pack_element as return type: SUCCESS$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
^EXIT=0$
