^CONVERSION ERROR$
--
Clang's __type_pack_element builtin alias template fails to evaluate
during return-type substitution in overload resolution, rejecting the
candidate ("found no match").  A local-typedef use works; only the
return-type path fails.  Residual root of cpp11_tuple_basic /
cpp11_libcxx_tuple (std::get<I>(tuple&)).
